    "description": "The Assign screen after selecting signals 2 (Pete, no group), 3 (Mike, Brothers Chat) and 4 (Rich, Tennis Chat) from the None-grouping list, then switching Assign By to Group. The GROUPS chip row shows only the distinct groups among the selected signals that actually have one — Brothers Chat and Tennis Chat — Pete's no-group signal (2) is silently excluded from this list rather than shown as a blank/placeholder group. Same rule applies to a narrower selection of just signals 2 and 4: switching to By Group would show only Tennis Chat."
